Description: Material 3 partition page for Kernora OS
 The partition step is the one installer page Calamares draws with widgets
 only. Kernora restyles it to match its Material 3 pages:
  - the disk bars are flat segments with fully rounded ends and small inner
    corners across a gap, without the 3D gradient; the selected segment
    carries a ring in the text colour;
  - the legend draws round colour dots and its text in the palette's text
    colours (upstream draws black and grey, unreadable on a dark theme);
  - partitions take colours from the Kernora palette, also in the size bar
    of the partition dialogs (KPMcore's own palette colours by file system);
  - the option rows (erase, manual, ...) can be drawn as cards by the
    branding's stylesheet, which sees the chosen one by a "checked" property
    and sets the colour of their warnings (upstream: red) as warningColor;
  - an image in the branding's images/ directory replaces the built-in one
    of the same name, so the page can use Material Symbols.
Author: Kernora Developers <developers@kernora.invalid>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-27
